          "content": "# Introduction\n## Table of Contents\n### Fencing Token\nA fencing token is a monotonically increasing number attached to an ownership grant. The storage system rejects writes carrying an older token than the newest accepted token.\n## Revision History\nThe heading names are editorial metadata."
